OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786637920
OL,3,CEurovision 2027 will take place in
OL,4,CBurgas, Bulgaria
OL,6,FThe Eurovision Song Contest 2027 will
OL,7,Ftake place in the Bulgarian city of
OL,8,FBurgas, organisers have confirmed.
OL,10,FIt's the first time the music
OL,11,Fextravaganza will be held in the
OL,12,FBalkan country, which scored its first-
OL,13,Fever victory in the contest in May,
OL,14,Fwhen Bulgarian singer Dara beat 24
OL,15,Fother competitors with her infectious
OL,16,Fparty anthem Bangaranga.
OL,18,FThe location was announced by
OL,19,FBulgaria's public TV broadcaster, BNT,
OL,20,Fand the European Broadcasting Union
OL,21,F(EBU) on Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
