OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786637920
OL,3,CEurovision 2027 will take place in
OL,4,CBurgas, Bulgaria
OL,6,FThe two semi-finals will take place at
OL,7,Fthe port city on Bulgaria's Black Sea
OL,8,Fcoast on May 11 and 13, 2027, while
OL,9,Fthe final will be held on May 15.
OL,11,FBulgaria's capital city, Sofia, had
OL,12,Falso applied to host the event.
OL,14,FEurovision director Martin Green said:
OL,15,F"Burgas will bring something truly
OL,16,Fspecial to Eurovision.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
