OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786637920
OL,3,CEurovision 2027 will take place in
OL,4,CBurgas, Bulgaria
OL,6,F"It is a dynamic and welcoming city on
OL,7,Fthe Black Sea coast with a strong
OL,8,Fmusical and cultural identity, which
OL,9,Fpossesses the ambition,
OL,10,Finfrastructure, and passion needed to
OL,11,Fwelcome the big Eurovision family."
OL,13,FMilena Milotinova, head of BNT, told a
OL,14,Fnews conference that together with the
OL,15,FEBU and Burgas they "will face
OL,16,Fintensive joint work to organise a
OL,17,Fcontest that will live up to the high
OL,18,Fexpectations of millions of viewers
OL,19,Faround the world".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
