OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786637920
OL,3,CEurovision 2027 will take place in
OL,4,CBurgas, Bulgaria
OL,6,FBurgas Mayor Dimitar Nikolov said
OL,7,Fhosting the contest was a major honour
OL,8,Ffor the city.
OL,10,FOn Wednesday, Eurovision organisers
OL,11,Fintroduced new rules barring countries
OL,12,Faffected by an armed conflict or other
OL,13,Fsecurity risks from hosting the
OL,14,Fcontest.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
