OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786637920
OL,3,CEurovision 2027 will take place in
OL,4,CBurgas, Bulgaria
OL,6,FUnder the new rules, the winning
OL,7,Fbroadcaster will be ineligible to host
OL,8,Fif an armed conflict, sensitive
OL,9,Fgeopolitical situation or other
OL,10,Fcircumstances threaten the security,
OL,11,Fsafety or stability of the country or
OL,12,Fsurrounding region.
OL,14,FThe contest has faced security
OL,15,Fconcerns in recent years as tensions
OL,16,Frose over the participation of Israel
OL,17,Fover its military actions in Gaza and
OL,18,Fthe Middle East.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
