PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786637920
OL,3,CEurovision 2027 will take place in
OL,4,CBurgas, Bulgaria
OL,6,FFive longtime participants - Spain,
OL,7,Fthe Netherlands, Ireland, Iceland and
OL,8,FSlovenia - boycotted in protest.
OL,10,FThe new rules also raised the minimum
OL,11,Fage for competitors from 16 to 18.
OL,12,FOrganisers say the change aims to
OL,13,Fboost safeguarding and protection of
OL,14,Fyounger artists from the pressures
OL,15,Fassociated with competing.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
